{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/gif8.gif?t=1741892869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations! Fresh off the farm and out of the circuit-barn, you've been selected as a member of the Agrifront Circuit Engineers. You've finally got the chance to help out the war effort. Put out your pipe and grab your multimeter - you've got a job to do, Technician. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/gif6.gif?t=1741892869\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve handcrafted and increasingly complicated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimize your solutions to increase your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the conflict between the Agrifront and the Assemble. Rewire everything from 3D printers to APCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete optional sections to unlock collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the rustic soundtrack and pixel art visuals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/extras/3.png?t=1741892869\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2114100?t=1741892869","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2114100?t=1741892869","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/9a9b41628ad726b98cb49d22b9f2fed72e9bcd3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741892869","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2114100/9a9b41628ad726b98cb49d22b9f2fed72e9bcd3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741892869","categories":[{"description":"Single-play